              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Creates a collection of files, which are available to the Partner in Partner Center, and the End Business in Business App. \n\nThe Activity will automatically be posted to the Activity Stream in Business App alerting users that they have a new file ready to download, and will include the supplied `description`.\n\nNote* This feature differs between the UI, and API. You must host the files and supply the urls when using the API. But if you use the file group system via the Vendor Center UI, you uploa"
        },
