                "name": "file_group_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "The ID of the file group to update."
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "This replaces the entire contents of a file group, so if you are looking to update a file group, ensure your including what is already in place along with your addition. Note* This feature differs between the UI, and API. You must host the files and supply the urls when using the API. But if you use the file group system via the Vendor Center UI, you upload the files, and Vendasta will host them.\n\nUnlike the File Group create, the replace action will not trigger an Activity to be sent to the Act"
        },
